  "description": "MongoDB adapters for WebReaper: the MongoDbSink, plus MongoDB-backed scraper-config and cookie storage. Adds ScraperEngineBuilder.WriteToMongoDb / WithMongoDbConfigStorage / WithMongoDbCookieStorage. Satellite package (ADR-0009) so the WebReaper core stays dependency-light and AOT-clean.",
